Package: nemo-cloud-setup
Version: 1.0.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, rclone, fuse3
Maintainer: Cloud Wizard
Description: Graphical Cloud Drive Setup Wizard for Nemo File Manager
 Easily connect Google Drive, OneDrive, Dropbox, and other cloud drives
 into the Nemo file manager without using the terminal.
